OL,3,AMicrosoft says attempts to fix global
OL,4,Aoutage not going 'as expected'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMicrosoft is struggling to fix a global
OL,7,Foutage, with services including Teams,
OL,8,FOutlook and AI software Copilot
OL,9,Faffected by "connectivity problems"
OL,11,FMicrosoft says the outage is not caused
OL,12,Fby a cyber-security incident
OL,14,FA monitoring website reports the outage
OL,15,Fis affecting users in 74 countries and
OL,16,Fhas been going on for more than 11
OL,17,Fhours
OL,19,FMicrosoft says its attempts to fix the
OL,20,Fissue are not "taking as expected"
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
