OL,3,AMicrosoft says attempts to fix global
OL,4,Aoutage not going 'as expected'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf this is not a cyber-attack, it is
OL,7,F"incredible incompetence", a technology
OL,8,Fexpert tells the BBC
OL,10,FMore than 430 million people use
OL,11,FMicrosoft 365 apps, and tech giants
OL,12,FOpenAI and Anthropic have reported
OL,13,Fproblems as a result of the outage
